    "summary": "Errata to Eager for Vengeance (Veterans of the Long War): only a **HERETIC ASTARTES** model that is not a **DAMNED** model can take it. Its unit can still shoot and declare a charge after Falling Back in the same turn, and:\n\n- if it Fell Back this turn, its models' attacks against your focus of hatred get +1 to Hit\n- whenever your focus of hatred is one of its charge targets, it gets +1 to its **Charge roll**",
